   "html_text": "An excellent scientific biography of Boltzmann ’s work is (Darrigol, 2018). Roughly speaking, one may divide Boltzmann’s work in four periods. The period 1866–1871 is more or less his formative period. In his first paper (1866), Boltzmann claimed to deriving the second law of thermodynamics from mechanics. The notion of probability does not appear in this paper. With hindsight, his youthful paper contained various weaknesses (cf. Darrigol (2018, 79)); but it set out an interest in the relation b",
   "md_text": "An excellent scientific biography of Boltzmann ’s work is (Darrigol, 2018). Roughly speaking, one may divide Boltzmann’s work in four periods. The period 1866–1871 is more or less his formative period. In his first paper (1866), Boltzmann claimed to deriving the second law of thermodynamics from mechanics. The notion of probability does not appear in this paper. With hindsight, his youthful paper contained various weaknesses (cf. Darrigol (2018, 79)); but it set out an interest in the relation b"
